+sensitive.</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-1-1.13">The feature tag is intended primarily for use in the following
+applications, protocols, services, or negotiation mechanisms:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-1-1.14">Any protocol that uses media tags</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-1-1.15">Examples of typical use:</dt>
