+protocols, services, or negotiation mechanisms:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-1-1.20">None</dd>
+        <dt pn="section-1-1.21">Interoperability considerations:</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-1-1.22">Aliases for charsets should not be
+used in media feature expressions because feature expression
+manipulation tools may convert aliases to the the principal
+name for the charset.  Even though charset names are not
+case-sensitive, values should be expressed as all lowercase
+letters to increase the likelihood of interoperability.  The
+&quot;charset&quot; capability should always be indicated in
+conjunction with any capability to handle textual data.</dd>
